#: ../../source/guides/institutional/index.md:1
msgid "Understanding the project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/institutional/index.md:3
msgid ""
"This section is for reading rather than for doing. It is written for "
"someone deciding whether this project is worth their attention, their "
"data, or their trust — a journalist, a researcher, an institution "
"weighing whether a figure from here can be cited, or simply somebody "
"curious about what a tool like this can honestly promise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/institutional/index.md:8
msgid ""
"Nothing here assumes a technical background, and nothing here is trying "
"to sell you anything. Where the answer is unflattering, the page says so:"
" a project that only publishes its strengths is asking to be taken on "
"faith, which is exactly what this one is built to avoid."
msgstr ""

