#: ../../source/guides/institutional/index.md:29
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every figure this project publishes about itself — how much of the code "
"is tested, how much of the documentation exists, how many files anyone "
"has vouched for — is **written by a command you can re-run**, and every "
"generated page says which command. That is deliberate, and it is the "
"whole posture: {doc}`../../generated/index` is where those pages live, "
"and none of them asks to be believed."
